{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-bot/tests/pricing.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-01T22:09:26.298330Z","id":"45b5c32244ff7d7410dfa5ab1f302154e8525e88903741fcbfd4943564dcde35","body":{"detail":"crates/clax-store/src/bot_runs.rs begin_step calls check_model_priced(tx, ov, model) without the key source, so a turn on an own key under require_explicit_price is refused before the run loop runs it. The store change that passes the key the person uses now (commit 2dcaf4b5f, 'fix(store): ... never refuse own-key runs for a price') makes the test pass: verified by applying it uncommitted and running bazel test //crates/clax-bot:all (both targets passed).","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":284},"end":{"line":301},"content_hash":"b523150a98bcfecf195f7596843751ae3fc8b2bdccfd400975055e781f919cee"},"suggested_fix":"Remove the #[ignore] once check_model_priced takes the key source on this branch.","summary":"an_own_key_runs_an_unpriced_model_under_require_explicit_price is #[ignore]d: Store::begin_step refuses model_not_priced for any key on this branch","tags":["pricing","tests","session:claude-code:f97e2315-5ffc-47c7-94a0-050e4e7b9835"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-bot/tests/pricing.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-01T22:14:01.818366Z","id":"ba290d7fa087224088bac83fabcd81dc54e5eb6efdc3f166b98602faddf29171","body":{"detail":"The only test reaching token_rate's own-key zero rate (run.rs:907-925) is an_own_key_runs_an_unpriced_model_under_require_explicit_price, which is #[ignore]d (45b5c322): deleting the fallback passes the suite. an_own_key_is_not_bounded_by_token_rates_it_is_not_charged covers only default rates (applies instance_key); affordable's other branch, an own key with a token rate that applies always, still bounding max_tokens, is untested.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":197},"end":{"line":213},"content_hash":"7407449eabf3a8855f5caf052aae324b05e9d56914fd6f4284963b3eb8583084"},"suggested_fix":"Unit-test token_rate (or Tick::rates) with require_explicit_price and no line on an own key; add a case where a token line applies always on an own key and max_tokens is bounded.","summary":"No running test exercises token_rate's own-key fallback or an own key bounded by a non-waived token rate","tags":["pricing","tests","review","session:claude-code:f97e2315-5ffc-47c7-94a0-050e4e7b9835"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-bot/tests/pricing.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-01T22:25:36.293612Z","id":"b2ed8b67bfee6f1b74347ebffa2b1773f1863265e620ef241b4f2595e9c45393","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"45b5c32244ff7d7410dfa5ab1f302154e8525e88903741fcbfd4943564dcde35","summary":"Fixed in git:a9ecb07d1: the #[ignore] is removed and the test passes now that turns begin through Store::begin_step_on with the chosen key; bazel test //crates/clax-bot/... passed (lib and integration: 'test result: ok. 59 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored'); SHAs are unsigned and change on re-signing. Proposed close.","tags":["session:claude-code:f97e2315-5ffc-47c7-94a0-050e4e7b9835"]}}
